{"metadata":{"title":"Teszt2","author":"Gemini","cover_image":"cover.jpg","language":"English","difficulty":"A1"},"content":[["Oliver loves ","the water. ","He has ","a long, ","bright kayak. ","He also has ","a little flying robot friend ","named Spark. ","Spark has ","a camera ","and goes buzz, buzz ","in the air. ","Today, ","Oliver and Spark ","go to ","the big blue lake. ","Oliver puts on ","his life jacket. ","He sits ","in his kayak. ","\"Ready, Spark?\" ","asks Oliver. ","Beep! ","says Spark. ","They are ready ","for an adventure!"],["Oliver paddles ","the kayak. ","Splash, splash ","goes the water. ","Spark flies ","up high into the sky. ","He looks down ","at the lake. ","Suddenly, ","Spark stops. ","He spins around in circles ","and flashes ","a green light. ","\"What is it, Spark?\" ","Oliver asks. ","Oliver paddles over ","to see. ","Look! ","There is something shiny ","in the water, ","stuck ","in the green plants. ","It is a small, ","silver toy boat. ","It is lost!"],["Oliver carefully ","picks up ","the toy boat ","from the water. ","\"Good job ","finding it, ","Spark!\" ","says Oliver. ","They paddle ","back to the shore. ","A little boy ","is sitting ","on the grass, ","looking sad. ","\"Is this ","your boat?\" ","Oliver asks. ","The boy ","smiles a big smile. ","\"Yes! ","Thank you!\" ","he says. ","Oliver and Spark ","are happy. ","It was ","a great day ","on the lake, ","and they helped ","a new friend."]]}